/P 60 0 R
/T (Every musician has a different musical personality. And therefore, every improviser \(regardless of classical or jazz background\) has a different personality. This by itself is the proof that there is no one-fits-all music education method that serves all musicians. )
/E (Every musician has a different musical personality. And therefore, every improviser \(regardless of classical or jazz background\) has a different personality. This by itself is the proof that there is no one-fits-all music education method that serves all musicians. )
