/T (We should all strive to be as well rounded as possible. I love looking at John Coltrane as a model of the most well-rounded musician ever. He is the perfect mix of risk, control, intensity, gentleness, creativity, support, dexterity, heart. )
/E (We should all strive to be as well rounded as possible. I love looking at John Coltrane as a model of the most well-rounded musician ever. He is the perfect mix of risk, control, intensity, gentleness, creativity, support, dexterity, heart. )
