/T (Below you can find a template for the La Folia, a famous harmonic form used during the Baroque period, just like a 12-bar blues form of the 17th century. Composers such as Marin Marais, Corelli, Vivaldi wrote many variations over these chords. A great exercise is to memorize this progression and try playing your own variations and improvisations with the recordings of Vivaldi's os Corelli's Folias. )
